<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="nav-row">
    <view class="back-btn" bindtap="goBack">‹</view>
  </view>

  <view class="hero-panel">
    <view class="hero-tag">支付页</view>
    <view class="hero-title">平台托管支付与风控确认</view>
    <view class="hero-copy">支付前再次核对金额结构、交付方式和平台协议。创业版产品里，这里对应托管支付、验货发货和押金原路退回的前台说明。</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{!order || !instrument}}" class="loading-state">正在获取订单...</view>

  <view wx:else>
    <view class="detail-block">
      <view class="block-card">
        <view class="feature-title">{{instrument.name}}</view>
        <view class="subtle-copy">{{instrument.school}} · {{order.sellerName}}</view>

        <view class="row-between">
          <text class="row-label">订单号</text>
          <text class="row-value">{{order.id}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="row-between">
          <text class="row-label">交易模式</text>
          <text class="row-value">{{order.tradeMode}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="row-between" wx:if="{{order.tradeMode === '租赁'}}">
          <text class="row-label">租期</text>
          <text class="row-value">{{order.startDate}} ~ {{order.endDate}}（{{order.rentDays}} 天）</text>
        </view>
        <view class="row-between" wx:if="{{order.tradeMode === '出售'}}">
          <text class="row-label">交付方式</text>
          <text class="row-value">平台验货与物流交付</text>
        </view>
        <view class="row-between">
          <text class="row-label">当前状态</text>
          <text class="row-value">{{order.status}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="summary-card">
      <view class="summary-title">支付拆分</view>
      <view class="summary-row" wx:if="{{order.tradeMode === '租赁'}}">
        <text>租金</text>
        <text>¥{{order.rentalAmount}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="summary-row" wx:if="{{order.tradeMode === '出售'}}">
        <text>买断金额</text>
        <text>¥{{order.saleAmount}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="summary-row">
        <text>保险</text>
        <text>¥{{order.insuranceFee}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="summary-row">
        <text>押金</text>
        <text>¥{{order.deposit}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="summary-row">
        <text>平台服务费</text>
        <text>¥{{order.platformServiceFee}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="summary-row total">
        <text>应付金额</text>
        <text>¥{{order.total}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="detail-block">
      <view class="block-card">
        <view class="row-between">
          <text class="row-label">平台保障</text>
          <text class="inline-link" bindtap="goAgreement">查看协议</text>
        </view>
        <view class="line-list">
          <view class="line-item">• 交易完成后，租赁场景的押金在设备按期归还并确认无损后原路退回。</view>
          <view class="line-item">• 若选择保险，物流磕碰、部件损耗和符合保单范围的事故可走保单分摊。</view>
          <view class="line-item">• 发生争议时，平台根据聊天记录、验货记录和协议条款介入处理。</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="stacked-actions">
      <view class="primary-cta" bindtap="payNow">立即支付</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
